Dialogue: 51,0:15:47.63,0:15:52.76,Typesetting,INSERT,0,0,60,,{\fad(200,300)\blur1\bord4\an2\fnNunito\3c&HE246E9&\b1}e {*\3c&HE049E1&}s{*\3c&HDF4BDD&}e{*\3c&HDE4CD9&}n{*\3c&HDD4ED5&}t{*\3c&HDD50D1&}a{*\3c&HDC51CE&}d{*\3c&HDB53CA&}o{*\3c&HDA55C6&}s {*\3c&HD858BE&}n{*\3c&HD85ABA&}a {*\3c&HD65DB3&}l{*\3c&HD55FAF&}u{*\3c&HD460AB&}a {*\3c&HD364A3&}c{*\3c&HD265A0&}r{*\3c&HD1679C&}e{*\3c&HD06998&}s{*\3c&HCF6A94&}c{*\3c&HCF6C90&}e{*\3c&HCE6E8C&}n{*\3c&HCD7089&}t{*\3c&HCC7185&}e{*\3c&HCB7381&}, {*\3c&HCA7679&}n{*\3c&HC97875&}u{*\3c&HC87A71&}m {*\3c&HC67D6A&}e{*\3c&HC67F66&}n{*\3c&HC58062&}c{*\3c&HC4825E&}o{*\3c&HC3845A&}n{*\3c&HC28557&}t{*\3c&HC28753&}r{*\3c&HC1894F&}o {*\3c&HBF8C47&}p{*\3c&HBE8E43&}e{*\3c&HBD8F40&}l{*\3c&HBD913C&}o {*\3c&HBB9434&}c{*\3c&HBA9630&}é{*\3c&HB9982C&}u{\3c&HB99A29&}
Dialogue: 50,0:16:07.15,0:16:08.16,Diálogo,,0,0,0,,Sena...
Dialogue: 50,0:16:08.91,0:16:09.78,Diálogo,,0,0,0,,Eu sei.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:12.03,0:16:13.99,Diálogo,,0,0,0,,Eu acho que...
Dialogue: 50,0:16:15.29,0:16:16.83,Diálogo,,0,0,0,,Eu realmente quero estar no palco.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:19.00,0:16:20.00,Diálogo,,0,0,0,,Eu também.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:24.05,0:16:26.13,Diálogo,,0,0,0,,Não foi divertido, Lulu-chan?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:26.13,0:16:29.93,Diálogo,,0,0,0,,Foi! Eu nem fiquei com medo,\Nporque estávamos juntas!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:30.43,0:16:35.22,Diálogo,,0,0,0,,Ah, já acabou.\NEu queria passar mais tempo com todo mundo!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:35.64,0:16:38.48,Diálogo,,0,0,0,,Vocês também se divertiram, pessoal?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:40.56,0:16:41.90,Diálogo,,0,0,0,,Eba!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:41.90,0:16:42.98,Diálogo,,0,0,0,,Que bom!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:43.40,0:16:45.19,Diálogo,,0,0,0,,Fomos muito bem, não é?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:45.19,0:16:47.24,Diálogo,,0,0,0,,Foi puxado.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:47.82,0:16:51.37,Diálogo,,0,0,0,,O pessoal da Once More\N também ajudou bastante!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:51.37,0:16:53.99,Diálogo,,0,0,0,,Não estaríamos aqui sem todos vocês!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:53.99,0:16:56.79,Diálogo,,0,0,0,,Estou muito feliz por ter\N conseguido encontrar com vocês!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:56.79,0:16:59.00,Diálogo,,0,0,0,,Este show foi um sucesso!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:59.58,0:17:02.92,Diálogo,,0,0,0,,Eu nunca vou esquecer o dia de hoje!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:03.38,0:17:06.84,Diálogo,,0,0,0,,Passei a amar cantar ainda mais!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:07.71,0:17:12.01,Diálogo,,0,0,0,,Esperamos continuar contando\n com o apoio de vocês pro LuluttoLilly!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:12.93,0:17:14.85,Diálogo,,0,0,0,,Muito obrigada!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:17.02,0:17:19.64,Diálogo,,0,0,0,,Muito obrigada, pessoal!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:57.72,0:17:58.64,Italic,,0,0,0,,Eu já me decidi.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:11.15,0:18:14.03,Diálogo,,0,0,0,,Eu não tô conseguindo dormir...
Dialogue: 50,0:18:15.03,0:18:17.20,Diálogo,,0,0,0,,Meu coração ainda está disparado...
Dialogue: 50,0:18:17.20,0:18:19.29,Diálogo,,0,0,0,,Parece que não acabou ainda.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:20.16,0:18:24.67,Diálogo,,0,0,0,,Quando usei magia pela primeira vez,\Npareceu um sonho pra mim,
Dialogue: 50,0:18:25.13,0:18:27.92,Diálogo,,0,0,0,,mas o show de hoje também\N me deu o mesmo sentimento.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:28.92,0:18:32.17,Diálogo,,0,0,0,,Uguisu, como eu fui hoje?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:32.17,0:18:33.43,Diálogo,,0,0,0,,Vai, me fala!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:34.47,0:18:36.55,Diálogo,,0,0,0,,Deixa isso pra lá...
Dialogue: 50,0:18:37.10,0:18:38.93,Diálogo,,0,0,0,,Ai, ai...
Dialogue: 50,0:18:42.14,0:18:42.93,Diálogo,,0,0,0,,Que frio...
Dialogue: 50,0:18:45.23,0:18:47.98,Diálogo,,0,0,0,,Hoje foi divertido.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:49.11,0:18:53.65,Diálogo,,0,0,0,,Eu realmente me transformei\Ne cantei na frente de todo mundo.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:55.78,0:18:59.62,Diálogo,,0,0,0,,A música da Lilly-san me deu forças naquele dia,
Dialogue: 50,0:19:00.87,0:19:02.33,Diálogo,,0,0,0,,e agora a minha música,
Dialogue: 50,0:19:03.04,0:19:05.04,Diálogo,,0,0,0,,fez todo mundo feliz.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:06.75,0:19:07.96,Diálogo,,0,0,0,,Parece que estou vivendo um sonho.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:09.50,0:19:12.84,Diálogo,,0,0,0,,Rui, está frio...
Dialogue: 50,0:19:13.13,0:19:14.80,Diálogo,,0,0,0,,Ah, desculpa.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:28.44,0:19:29.36,Diálogo,,0,0,0,,Onee-chan.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:30.02,0:19:31.23,Diálogo,,0,0,0,,Bom dia!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:31.23,0:19:32.11,Diálogo,,0,0,0,,Bom dia.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:32.61,0:19:34.15,Diálogo,,0,0,0,,Você acordou cedo hoje.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:34.15,0:19:36.70,Diálogo,,0,0,0,,Você também, Fuu.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:36.70,0:19:39.12,Diálogo,,0,0,0,,É. Eu acabei acordando.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:41.16,0:19:46.37,Diálogo,,0,0,0,,Ei... ontem aconteceu\N uma coisa boa comigo.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:47.21,0:19:48.13,Diálogo,,0,0,0,,O que foi?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:49.00,0:19:51.00,Diálogo,,0,0,0,,Não, deixa pra lá.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:54.63,0:19:56.51,Diálogo,,0,0,0,,Hoje parece que vai\N ser um clima agradável.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:56.51,0:19:57.26,Diálogo,,0,0,0,,Sim.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:58.30,0:20:00.80,Diálogo,,0,0,0,,Talvez eu vá dar uma caminhada.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:01.51,0:20:02.76,Diálogo,,0,0,0,,Eu também vou!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:04.22,0:20:06.14,Diálogo,,0,0,0,,Vamos logo, Onee-chan!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:06.14,0:20:06.89,Diálogo,,0,0,0,,Tá bom.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:16.86,0:20:18.28,Diálogo,,0,0,0,,Está um clima gostoso.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:19.11,0:20:21.03,Diálogo,,0,0,0,,Você parece feliz hoje, Onee-chan!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:22.24,0:20:24.87,Diálogo,,0,0,0,,Aconteceu alguma coisa boa?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:26.41,0:20:28.29,Diálogo,,0,0,0,,Sim! Dá para perceber?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:28.29,0:20:31.29,Diálogo,,0,0,0,,Ah, eu sabia!\N Eu sabia que era o caso!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:31.59,0:20:33.55,Diálogo,,0,0,0,,Ei, me conta!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:34.84,0:20:35.96,Diálogo,,0,0,0,,Ontem...
Dialogue: 50,0:20:37.63,0:20:40.22,Diálogo,,0,0,0,,Eu sonhei que estava voando pelo céu.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:41.97,0:20:44.68,Diálogo,,0,0,0,,Ei, eu tive o mesmo sonho.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:44.68,0:20:45.77,Diálogo,,0,0,0,,Você também?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:45.77,0:20:46.48,Diálogo,,0,0,0,,Sim!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:47.10,0:20:51.23,Diálogo,,0,0,0,,Ah! Então a gente é igual! {É a mesma coisa}
Dialogue: 50,0:20:59.78,0:21:00.99,Diálogo,,0,0,0,,Hã?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:08.16,0:21:09.83,Italic,,0,0,0,,Eu nunca tinha pensado...
Dialogue: 50,0:21:10.29,0:21:13.79,Italic,,0,0,0,,que poderia existir outra\N maga além de mim.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:13.79,0:21:15.00,Diálogo-Alt,,0,0,0,,Porque...
Dialogue: 50,0:21:15.75,0:21:18.26,Diálogo-Alt,,0,0,0,,Eu consigo usar magia de verdade.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:20.63,0:21:22.05,Diálogo-Alt,,0,0,0,,Porque...
Dialogue: 50,0:21:22.68,0:21:24.72,Diálogo-Alt,,0,0,0,,Eu consigo usar magia de verdade.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:25.89,0:21:26.93,Diálogo-Alt,,0,0,0,,Hã?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:27.56,0:21:28.31,Diálogo-Alt,,0,0,0,,Aqui!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:29.02,0:21:31.60,Diálogo-Alt,,0,0,0,,Eu vi esses outro dia e achei fofos,
Dialogue: 50,0:21:31.60,0:21:33.81,Diálogo-Alt,,0,0,0,,então vou te dar um!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:34.31,0:21:37.07,Diálogo-Alt,,0,0,0,,Ela vinha em par.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:42.07,0:21:45.24,Diálogo-Alt,,0,0,0,,Vai dar tudo certo. É só fazermos o show\Ncomo sempre fazemos.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:45.24,0:21:47.29,Diálogo-Alt,,0,0,0,,É só relaxar.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:52.92,0:21:57.67,Diálogo,,0,0,0,,{\i1}
Dialogue: 50,0:21:57.67,0:22:02.34,Diálogo,,0,0,0,,{\i1}
Dialogue: 50,0:22:08.39,0:22:10.68,Italic,,0,0,0,,Verdade. Essa é...
Dialogue: 50,0:22:14.10,0:22:15.69,Italic,,0,0,0,,a música que fizemos,
Dialogue: 50,0:22:16.82,0:22:19.44,Italic,,0,0,0,,quando eramos pequenas.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:22.53,0:22:23.66,Italic,,0,0,0,,Será que a Fuu...
Dialogue: 50,0:22:24.82,0:22:26.20,Italic,,0,0,0,,na verdade é...
Dialogue: 2,0:22:28.37,0:22:32.00,ED,,0,0,0,,{=21}{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Coragem está em dois mundos, juntos agora
Dialogue: 2,0:22:32.00,0:22:32.66,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}(Essa é a prova!)
Dialogue: 2,0:22:33.41,0:22:35.37,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}É isso que nos conecta
Dialogue: 2,0:22:35.37,0:22:38.71,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Todos sorriem para garotas bonitas
Dialogue: 2,0:22:38.71,0:22:39.84,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}(Meu Sonho!)
Dialogue: 2,0:22:40.59,0:22:42.51,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Só quero saber o que o futuro guarda
Dialogue: 2,0:22:42.51,0:22:43.13,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}(Sozinha!)
Dialogue: 2,0:22:43.13,0:22:47.09,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Mesmo que as estrelas em um céu sem lua
Dialogue: 2,0:22:47.59,0:22:49.85,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}ainda brilhem
Dialogue: 2,0:22:49.18,0:22:50.01,ED,,0,0,0,,{\an3\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}(Sem magia!)
Dialogue: 2,0:22:49.85,0:22:54.64,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Mesmo que as nuvens em um céu sem sol
Dialogue: 2,0:22:54.64,0:22:57.06,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}ainda sigam seu caminho
