Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.93,0:01:57.60,OP,,0,0,0,,{\c&HE52FD3&\bord6\blur10\fad(150,150)}Meu coração está acelerado
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.60,0:02:00.23,OP,,0,0,0,,{\c&HE52FD3&\bord6\blur10\fad(150,150)}O que se reflete nesses olhos
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.23,0:02:03.02,OP,,0,0,0,,{\c&HE52FD3&\bord6\blur10\fad(150,150)}São as cores de um novo mundo
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.48,0:02:04.53,OP,,0,0,0,,{\c&HE52FD3&\bord6\blur10\fad(150,150)}Woah
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.57,0:02:08.20,OP,,0,0,0,,{\c&HE52FD3&\bord6\blur10\fad(150,150)}Fique ao meu lado hoje também
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.20,0:02:11.20,OP,,0,0,0,,{\c&HE52FD3&\bord6\blur10\fad(150,150)}Vamos seguir enquanto seguro sua mão
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.20,0:02:14.99,OP,,0,0,0,,{\c&HE52FD3&\bord6\blur10\fad(150,150)}Anseio por um lugar onde eu possa brilhar
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.58,0:02:21.00,OP,,0,0,0,,{\c&HE52FD3&\bord6\blur10\fad(150,150)}Enquanto um som mágico ecoa
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.83,0:02:24.50,OP,,0,0,0,,{\c&HE52FD3&\bord6\blur10\fad(150,150)}Eu quero cantar com você
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.50,0:02:26.51,OP,,0,0,0,,{\c&HE52FD3&\bord6\blur10\fad(150,150)}Vamos cantar juntos
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.51,0:02:30.30,OP,,0,0,0,,{\c&HE52FD3&\bord6\blur10\fad(150,150)}Você é uma estrela que brilha intensamente
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.30,0:02:31.97,OP,,0,0,0,,{\c&HE52FD3&\bord6\blur10\fad(150,150)}Meu bubee, bubee, bubee love
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.39,0:02:34.85,OP,,0,0,0,,{\c&HE52FD3&\bord6\blur10\fad(150,150)}Podemos ser estrelas brilhantes
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.85,0:02:36.60,OP,,0,0,0,,{\c&HE52FD3&\bord6\blur10\fad(150,150)}Mesmo com o tempo passando,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.60,0:02:39.35,OP,,0,0,0,,{\c&HE52FD3&\bord6\blur10\fad(150,150)}é uma magia secreta
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.35,0:02:43.31,OP,,0,0,0,,{\c&HE52FD3&\bord6\blur10\fad(150,150)}Meu bubee, bubee, bubee love
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.31,0:02:46.03,OP,,0,0,0,,{\c&HE52FD3&\bord6\blur10\fad(150,150)}Ooh, ooh, ooh
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.03,0:02:48.07,OP,,0,0,0,,{\c&HE52FD3&\bord6\blur10\fad(150,150)}Você é meu pequeno companheiro
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.07,0:02:53.32,OP,,0,0,0,,{\c&HE52FD3&\bord6\blur10\fad(150,150)}Ei, bubee love
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.32,0:02:53.32,OP,,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&HE52FD3&\bord6\blur10\fad(150,150)}Bubee, bubee, bubee love
